msgstr "Negeren"

#: includes/AdminNotice.php:118
msgid "New in ImageCraft: Image Fallbacks — never show a broken image again."
msgstr ""
"Nieuw in ImageCraft: fallback-afbeeldingen — nooit meer een kapotte "
"afbeelding tonen."

#: includes/AdminNotice.php:119
msgid ""
"Pick one fallback image: it replaces broken images for your visitors and "
"acts as the featured image for posts without one. Non-destructive and off by "
